Status
You have something of a reputation and standing
(earned or unearned) within a specified local community
of Kindred, probably Camarilla or Anarch. Status
among Camarilla society derives as often from your
sire’s status and the respect due your particular bloodline
as it does from personal achievement. High Status
among Anarchs theoretically depends on the character’s
contributions, but more often to their degree of
connection (by Blood or coterie) to the current Baron
or other ruler.
Status in one sect does not transfer to the other.
