at the set Difficulty. (The opposition
doesn’t roll.) The more player
characters that win, the better
the results. If the majority of the
player characters win, the opposition
might for example break, fall
down wounded, storm off in a fit
of pique, surrender, or whatever
else makes dramatic sense.
sample difficulties:
■■ The opposition is significantly
weaker or the the goal simple
to achieve: Difficulty 2
■■ Both parties are equally
