debriefings. Like all other techniques
in this Appendix it’s meant
to make the game more fun, not
force players to do things they are
uncomfortable with.
Debriefing does not need
to last for a set amount of time
(five minutes per player is usually
enough). However, after a particularly
intense session, it’s probably a
good idea to have a longer debriefing
period than normal.
